 # tags: rfd:details
 Text:RFD2028  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-08-25T00:01:47Z (RFD66606-2028) '(UDP 39539), and each `sibling-repos.txt` declares the wiring. The
 # tags: rfd:details
